WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.830
Ethiopia, 2023.

2
00:00:02.880 --> 00:00:07.570
Its goods exports were
worth 2,859 million dollars.

3
00:00:07.620 --> 00:00:11.930
Its goods imports: 17,050 million dollars.

4
00:00:11.980 --> 00:00:14.290
Almost six times as much.

5
00:00:14.340 --> 00:00:17.650
Its top exports include
coffee, sesame seeds,

6
00:00:17.700 --> 00:00:19.910
cut flowers and vegetables.

7
00:00:19.960 --> 00:00:23.410
So why can't Ethiopia
simply sell more goods?

8
00:00:23.460 --> 00:00:25.350
Has it nothing the world wants?

9
00:00:25.400 --> 00:00:27.470
Does it already sell all it can?

10
00:00:27.520 --> 00:00:30.550
In this mission, you'll
map what Ethiopia trades,

11
00:00:30.600 --> 00:00:34.870
and with whom: the goods going
out, and the goods coming in.

12
00:00:34.920 --> 00:00:39.310
Then you'll weigh the opportunities and
the challenges Ethiopia faces in world

13
00:00:39.360 --> 00:00:40.390
trade.

14
00:00:40.440 --> 00:00:45.240
Your mission: explain why Ethiopia
can't simply sell more goods.
